  "description": "ASP.NET Core validation for Formidable on FluentValidation. A minimal-API endpoint filter and an MVC [Validate] attribute run a validation profile and answer an error with a 400 ValidationProblemDetails. Its paths are the ones the Blazor client applies back onto its fields. A Native AOT app validates its minimal APIs with the endpoint filter; [Validate] is for MVC, which Native AOT does not support.",
